{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789824952569,"sessionID":"ses_f461f6897ffeZJz46cQwZkb8iB","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9e167a3001vRi8iT6w9WZ9te","sessionID":"ses_f461f6897ffeZJz46cQwZkb8iB","messageID":"msg_0b9e1466a001asiXo1YVdzSHTM","type":"tool","id":"call_00_FhQlaQgpVPIMI1LQglQt3702","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /tmp/opencode/petsmart && grep -n \"~~~ PAGE\" paged.txt | head -50 && grep -n \"The Parties to the Merger Agreement\\|THE PARTIES\\|Financing\\|Voting Agreement\\|Merger Agreement\\b\\|Governance\\|Termination Fee\\|Rollover\" paged.txt | head -80"},"output":"1:~~~ PAGE 1 ~~~\n3:~~~ PAGE 2 ~~~\n795:~~~ PAGE 3 ~~~\n848:~~~ PAGE 4 ~~~\n885:~~~ PAGE 5 ~~~\n938:~~~ PAGE 6 ~~~\n983:~~~ PAGE 7 ~~~\n1033:~~~ PAGE 8 ~~~\n1080:~~~ PAGE 9 ~~~\n1093:~~~ PAGE 10 ~~~\n1156:~~~ PAGE 11 ~~~\n1224:~~~ PAGE 12 ~~~\n1281:~~~ PAGE 13 ~~~\n1340:~~~ PAGE 14 ~~~\n1383:~~~ PAGE 15 ~~~\n1427:~~~ PAGE 16 ~~~\n1445:~~~ PAGE 17 ~~~\n1485:~~~ PAGE 18 ~~~\n1522:~~~ PAGE 19 ~~~\n1567:~~~ PAGE 20 ~~~\n1596:~~~ PAGE 21 ~~~\n1631:~~~ PAGE 22 ~~~\n1665:~~~ PAGE 23 ~~~\n1697:~~~ PAGE 24 ~~~\n1728:~~~ PAGE 25 ~~~\n1761:~~~ PAGE 26 ~~~\n1796:~~~ PAGE 27 ~~~\n1842:~~~ PAGE 28 ~~~\n1895:~~~ PAGE 29 ~~~\n1951:~~~ PAGE 30 ~~~\n1996:~~~ PAGE 31 ~~~\n2034:~~~ PAGE 32 ~~~\n2115:~~~ PAGE 33 ~~~\n2312:~~~ PAGE 34 ~~~\n2525:~~~ PAGE 35 ~~~\n2566:~~~ PAGE 36 ~~~\n2628:~~~ PAGE 37 ~~~\n2662:~~~ PAGE 38 ~~~\n2882:~~~ PAGE 39 ~~~\n3192:~~~ PAGE 40 ~~~\n3242:~~~ PAGE 41 ~~~\n3284:~~~ PAGE 42 ~~~\n3343:~~~ PAGE 43 ~~~\n3377:~~~ PAGE 44 ~~~\n3410:~~~ PAGE 45 ~~~\n3461:~~~ PAGE 46 ~~~\n3500:~~~ PAGE 47 ~~~\n3542:~~~ PAGE 48 ~~~\n3838:~~~ PAGE 49 ~~~\n4207:~~~ PAGE 50 ~~~\n220:THE PARTIES TO THE MERGER AGREEMENT\n396:Financing\n404:Termination Fee Commitment Letters\n468:Explanatory Note Regarding the Merger Agreement\n571:Termination Fees\n737:The Parties to the Merger Agreement (page 16)\n741:The Parties to the Merger Agreement — PetSmart, Inc.\n751:The Parties to the Merger Agreement — Argos Holdings Inc. and Argos Merger Sub Inc.\n798:The Merger Agreement — Other Covenants and Agreements — No Solicitation\n910:Financing (Page 40)\n916:The Merger (Proposal 1) — Financing — Debt Financing\n923:The Merger (Proposal 1) — Financing —  Equity Financing\n931:Termination Fee Commitment Letters (Page 44)\n936:The Merger — Termination Fee Commitment Letters\n959:The Merger Agreement — Other Covenants and Agreements — No Solicitation\n974:The Merger Agreement — Other Covenants and Agreements — No Solicitation\n1001:The Merger Agreement — Termination\n1029:The Merger Agreement — Other Covenants and Agreements — No Solicitation\n1044:The Merger Agreement — Other Covenants and Agreements — No Solicitation\n1052:Termination Fees (Page 71)\n1064:The Merger Agreement — Termination Fees\n1238:The Merger Agreement — Termination Fees\n1240:The Merger Agreement — Reimbursement of Expenses.\n1432:THE PARTIES TO THE MERGER AGREEMENT\n1462:The Merger Agreement.\n1865:— Termination Fee Commitment Letters”\n1867:The Merger Agreement — Termination Fees.\n1947:The Merger Agreement — Termination Fees.\n3201:Financing\n3207:— Debt Financing\n3214:— Equity Financing\n3220:Equity Financing\n3247:The Merger Agreement — Specific Performance\n3273:The Merger Agreement — Specific Performance\n3277:Debt Financing\n3405:Termination Fee Commitment Letters\n3416:The Merger Agreement — Termination Fees\n3418:The Merger Agreement — Reimbursement of Expenses\n3443:The Merger Agreement — Other Covenants and Agreements — No Solicitation\n3551:The Merger Agreement — Indemnification of Directors and Officers; Insurance\n4357:Explanatory Note Regarding the Merger Agreement\n4396:Financing\n4966:Financing\n5243:Termination Fees\n5244:Company Termination Fee\n5276:Parent Termination Fee\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"1:~~~ PAGE 1 ~~~\n3:~~~ PAGE 2 ~~~\n795:~~~ PAGE 3 ~~~\n848:~~~ PAGE 4 